  "description": "Compact dual-bar moving-head effect: two independently tilting horizontal bars, each carrying four square lenses with fixed amber, blue, green and red LEDs from left to right. A common U-shaped frame pans on a stationary rectangular base. Eight independently dimmable single-colour 3 W LEDs; 540 degree pan and 150 degree tilt. Rest pose standing on the base with both bars facing forward.",
